---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site, mailHref, telHref, phHtml } from '../config/site';
import { films } from '../config/media';

const operator = phHtml(site.legal.operator, 'operator name');
const address = phHtml(site.legal.address, 'postal address');
const email = phHtml(site.email, 'email address');
const phone = phHtml(site.phoneDisplay, '+91 XXXXX XXXXX');
const retention = phHtml(site.legal.retention, 'period');
const externalVideo = Object.values(films).some((f) => /^https?:/.test(f.src));
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How The Second Visit collects, uses and protects the information you share through this website.">
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>This website belongs to The Second Visit, a hospitality mentorship service run by <span set:html={operator} /> in {site.city}, {site.region}, India. In this policy, “we” and “us” mean The Second Visit.</p>
  <p>Postal address: <span set:html={address} />. Email: <a href={mailHref()} set:html={email} />. Phone: <a href={telHref()} set:html={phone} />.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect what you choose to send us. When you use the enquiry form, we receive:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and phone or WhatsApp number</li>
    <li>your café or restaurant name, if you give it</li>
    <li>the stage your business is at and your team size</li>
    <li>your message, if you write one, and how you prefer to be contacted</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you call, message or email us, we receive whatever you share in that conversation.</p>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <p>This website has no user accounts and takes no payments. It does not use advertising or analytics cookies, and it does not track you across other websites.</p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <p>We use your details only to reply to your enquiry, arrange a conversation and, if you go ahead, provide the mentorship you ask for. We do not sell or rent your information, and we do not send marketing messages without your consent.</p>

  <h2>Who processes it for us</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> delivers enquiry form submissions to our email inbox.</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel</strong> hosts this website. Like any web host, its servers keep short-lived technical logs, such as your IP address and browser type, to deliver and protect the site.</li>
    {externalVideo && <li><strong>Pixabay</strong> serves the background videos on some pages, so your browser connects to its servers to load them.</li>}
    <li>Our email and phone providers hold the messages you send us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Some of these providers may store data outside India.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>If you do not become a client, we delete your enquiry within <span set:html={retention} />. If you do, we keep your details for as long as we work together and as required by law.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you can ask us to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>tell you what personal data we hold about you and how we use it</li>
    <li>correct, complete or update it</li>
    <li>delete it, or withdraw consent you have given</li>
    <li>nominate someone to act for you</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To do any of these, or to raise a concern, write to <a href={mailHref()} set:html={email} />. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may complain to the Data Protection Board of India.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>The website is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). We limit access to your information to the people who need it to reply to you.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for business owners and is not directed at anyone under 18.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</Legal>
